Template: odeion/mode
Type: select
Choices-C: bundle, node
Choices: Odeion with its own homeserver (recommended), Odeion only
Default: bundle
Description: What should this machine run?
 Odeion with its own homeserver: the Odeion node and a Pubky homeserver for your
 sign-in and your music's backups, all on this machine. Choose this if you are
 not sure.
 .
 Odeion only: just the Odeion node. You sign in with a Pubky homeserver you
 already have, in the web setup after the install.
